<sbb-title level="2">Font Family.</sbb-title>
<div class="token-table face-typo-token">
{% for token in lyne.components.designtokentypography.family %}
    <div class="row">
        <div class="token-name"><p>{{ token.name }}</p></div>
        <div class="token-value"><p>{{ token.value }}</p></div>
    </div>
{% endfor %}
</div>

<sbb-title level="2">Scale.</sbb-title>
<div class="token-table scalye-typo-token">
{% for token in lyne.components.designtokentypography.scale %}
    <div class="row">
        <div class="token-name"><p>{{ token.name }}</p></div>
        <div class="token-value"><p>{{ token.value }}</p></div>
        <div class="token-demo"><p class="typo-scale-demo" style="font-size: {{token.original.value}}px; line.height: {{token.original.value}}px;">Scale</p></div>
    </div>
{% endfor %}
</div>

<sbb-title level="2">Letter Spacing.</sbb-title>
<div class="token-table letter-spacing-typo-token">
{% for token in lyne.components.designtokentypography.letterspacing %}
    <div class="row">
        <div class="token-name"><p>{{ token.name }}</p></div>
        <div class="token-value"><p>{{ token.value }}</p></div>
        <div class="token-demo"><p class="typo-face-demo" style="letter-spacing: {{token.value}};">Letter Spacing</p></div>
    </div>
{% endfor %}
</div>


<sbb-title level="2">Line Height.</sbb-title>
<div class="token-table line-height-typo-token">
{% for token in lyne.components.designtokentypography.lineheight %}
    <div class="row">
        <div class="token-name"><p>{{ token.name }}</p></div>
        <div class="token-value"><p>{{ token.value }}</p></div>
        <div class="token-demo"><p class="typo-face-demo" style="line-height: {{token.value}};">Line Height</p></div>
    </div>
{% endfor %}
</div>

<sbb-title level="2">Listen.</sbb-title>
<p>Lyne bietet Listenstile, die auf die nativen HTML-Listen angewendet werden. Die Schriftgrösse wird mit einer Text-Klasse wie <code>sbb-text-m</code> festgelegt.</p>
<sbb-table-wrapper>
<table class="sbb-table sbb-table--striped">
    <thead><tr><th style="white-space: nowrap;">Liste</th><th style="white-space: nowrap;">CSS-Klasse</th><th style="white-space: nowrap;">Sass-Mixin</th><th>Verwendung</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
        <tr><td style="white-space: nowrap;">Standard</td><td style="white-space: nowrap;"><code>sbb-list</code></td><td style="white-space: nowrap;"><code>list</code></td><td>Auf <code>ul</code> und <code>ol</code>, auch verschachtelt. Die Farbe wird geerbt.</td></tr>
        <tr><td style="white-space: nowrap;">Schritte</td><td style="white-space: nowrap;"><code>sbb-step-list</code></td><td style="white-space: nowrap;"><code>step-list</code></td><td>Nur auf <code>ol</code>. Beschreibt eine Abfolge von Schritten.</td></tr>
        <tr><td style="white-space: nowrap;">Icon</td><td style="white-space: nowrap;"><code>sbb-icon-list</code></td><td style="white-space: nowrap;"><code>icon-list</code></td><td>Icon als Aufzählungszeichen, standardmässig <code>circle-tick-small</code>. Eigenes Icon mit <code>--sbb-icon-list-marker-icon</code>, Icon-Farbe mit <code>--sbb-icon-list-marker-icon-color</code>.</td></tr>
        <tr><td style="white-space: nowrap;">Beschreibung</td><td style="white-space: nowrap;"><code>sbb-list</code></td><td style="white-space: nowrap;"><code>description-list</code></td><td>Auf <code>dl</code> für Label und Beschreibung. Die Farbe wird geerbt.</td></tr>
    </tbody>
</table>
</sbb-table-wrapper>

<sbb-title level="3">Standard.</sbb-title>
<ul class="sbb-list sbb-text-m"><li>Erster Punkt</li><li>Zweiter Punkt</li></ul>
<sbb-title level="3">Schritte.</sbb-title>
<ol class="sbb-step-list sbb-text-m"><li>Erster Schritt</li><li>Zweiter Schritt</li></ol>
<sbb-title level="3">Icon.</sbb-title>
<ul class="sbb-icon-list sbb-text-m"><li>Aufgabe erstellt</li><li>Änderungen übernommen</li></ul>
<sbb-title level="3">Beschreibung.</sbb-title>
<dl class="sbb-list"><dt>Label:</dt><dd>Beschreibung des Labels.</dd></dl>
